			(property "Description" "-4.0A Id, -30V Vds, P-Channel MOSFET, SOT-23 (AOS AO3401A). Flattened cache copy of KiCad default Transistor_FET:AO3401A (which normally uses (extends \"TP0610T\") for its graphics/pins) -- flattened here (graphics/pins duplicated directly, no extends) because kicad-cli's headless schematic loader fails to resolve extends-based symbol inheritance for cached lib_symbols entries outside a fully live project/library context (reproduced directly: an extends-based pair failed to load standalone via kicad-cli sch export bom/erc, while an otherwise-identical flattened copy loaded and validated cleanly). Pinout (1=G, 2=S, 3=D) and ratings verified against the same TP0610T graphic/pin layout KiCad's own AO3401A already inherits, and against the real AOS AO3401A datasheet above."
				(at 0 0 0)
